/*
 * Nexus -- the champion (fifth trainer) of each Ultra Beast expedition.
 * PROPOSAL, not built into the ROM. Design and dialogue: ULTRA_BEASTS.md
 *
 * Follows NEXUS_REGRAS.md:
 *   R10/R11  each team = 1 legendary + 1 semi-legendary + 1 Mega + 3 common
 *   R13      31 IVs and 252 EVs in every stat
 *   R2       levels are scaled to the player's highest (PARTY_HIGHEST), so the
 *            Level: 100 below is only a ceiling for the scaler
 *   R10      every team must work in Singles and Doubles; "Double Battle" is the
 *            format it shines in when the Battle Format option is Default
 * Megas: this hack triggers Mega Evolution with TYPE stones (Steeltite,
 * Electrite, Bugtite...), per src/data/pokemon/form_change_tables.h.
 * Pic/Class marked NEW in the doc do not exist yet. Checked with tools/trainerproc.
 */

